        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: “Raabta” (song), Agent Vinod, Raabta, Heropanti\n- People: Saif Ali Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Deepika Padukone, Sushant Singh Rajput, Kriti Sanon, Jim Sarbh, Sabbir Khan\n- Awards: Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut\n\nFacts:\n- “Raabta” is a romantic Hindi song from the 2012 Bollywood film Agent Vinod.\n- The music video for “Raabta” features Saif Ali Khan and Kareena Kapoor Khan.\n- The remix video of “Raabta” stars Deepika Padukone, Sushant Singh Rajput, Kriti Sanon, and Jim Sarbh from the film Raabta.\n- Kriti Sanon’s first Bollywood film was Sabbir Khan’s romantic action drama Heropanti.\n- Kriti Sanon won the Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut for Heropanti.",
